# Vendor manuals — large & proprietary, kept locally for reference only (see docs/design.md §11)
docs/manuals/

# Ad-hoc bench probe output (local research tooling, not shipped). The probe
# scripts themselves are tracked: they are the Phase 2 deliverable (design §12).
/probe_out*/

# Raw bench register captures carry the analyzer's serial number and factory
# calibration tables; they stay local until the capture policy is settled
# (design §13.1 #11). A sanitized bank is committed with the simulator in Phase 3.
/tests/fixtures/captures/zpa_bench_*.json
